title WF02 Research gap analysis and expert validation - activity
|Project member or researcher|
start
:Enter topic and select evidence papers;
:Run gap analysis;
|LumiGap platform|
:Charge credits, queue analysis;
:Retrieve evidence and ask the AI model for gaps;
if (Success?) then (no)
  :Mark failed and refund credits;
  |Project member or researcher|
  :Retry as a new run;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|LumiGap platform|
:Store gaps as CANDIDATE\nwith corpus probe counts;
|Project member or researcher|
:Review AI candidate gaps and add evidence;
:Request expert validation;
|LumiGap platform|
:Mark UNDER_VALIDATION\nand list in expert queue;
repeat
  |Verified expert|
  :Pick a gap from the queue
(no conflict of interest);
  :Record VALIDATE, CHALLENGE, REQUEST_EVIDENCE,
SUGGEST_EVIDENCE, REFINE_SCOPE or REJECT;
  |LumiGap platform|
  if (Quorum reached?) then (VALIDATE quorum,
no objection)
    :VALIDATED;
  elseif () then (REJECT quorum)
    :REJECTED;
  elseif () then (REFINE_SCOPE)
    :REFINED;
  else (otherwise)
    :Stay UNDER_VALIDATION;
  endif
repeat while (Still UNDER_VALIDATION?) is (yes) not (no)
|Project member or researcher|
:Read decisions and refine the gap;
stop
@enduml
